      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of the tank being empty is exhausting, and it's completely understandable that you see this as a burden rather than a fresh start. You gave so much to the world, and now the world has nothing left to ask of you. Maybe the most important thing to do now is to allow yourself the grace to simply *be* without the pressure of needing a grand purpose.",
